{"id":"slovno","lemma":"словно","pos":"conj","rank":480,"glosses":["as if, like"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/1c/Ru-%D1%81%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Мы словно братья.","en":"We're like brothers.","words":[{"g":"we"},null,{"g":"brother","l":"брат"}]},{"text":"Я помню, словно это было вчера.","en":"I remember it as if it were yesterday.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to remember","l":"помнить"},null,{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"yesterday"}]},{"text":"Том - словно член семьи.","en":"Tom is like one of the family.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,{"g":"limb"},{"g":"family","l":"семья"}]},{"text":"Том теперь словно другой человек.","en":"Tom is like a different person now.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"now, at present"},null,{"g":"other"},{"g":"person"}]},{"text":"Он всегда говорит так, словно знает всё.","en":"He always talks as if he knows everything.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"always"},{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"},{"g":"so"},null,{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},{"g":"everything, all"}]}]}